### VigiDoor Security Control API Tests
### 使用 VS Code REST Client 插件运行 (humao.rest-client)

#@baseUrl = http://192.168.38.166:5002
@baseUrl = 192.168.1.119
@deviceId = VIGIDOOR_116b411d946be190_UBT


# ============================================================
# 一、布防
# ============================================================

### 布防 - 向设备下发 arm 指令
### topic: vigidoor/down/{{deviceId}}/command/security
POST {{baseUrl}}/vigidoor/api/v1/security/arm
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "device_id": "{{deviceId}}"
}

###


# ============================================================
# 二、撤防
# ============================================================

### 撤防 - 向设备下发 disarm 指令
### topic: vigidoor/down/{{deviceId}}/command/security
POST {{baseUrl}}/vigidoor/api/v1/security/disarm
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "device_id": "{{deviceId}}"
}

###


# ============================================================
# 三、异常场景
# ============================================================

### 缺少 device_id - 应返回 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/vigidoor/api/v1/security/arm
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
